            "review_title": "Review at Banh My Tam Ha Noi",
            "review_text": "Sara M\n18 contributions\n0\nCheap, Cheerful and Delicious!\nJun 2025 • Friends\nMy friend and I had lunch here today. I had the Veg Banh Mi and my friend had the Hanoi Special Banh Mi, we shared the delicious and generously sized Mango Sticky Rice Ice Cream. The Banh Mis prepared by Huyen were the best we’ve had this trip to Vietnam. They were well priced, fresh and assembled with care. We can’t wait to visit again. Thank you to the lovely Huyen for your great service!\nRead more\nWritten June 25, 2025",
